    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed </strong>Braind <strong> - Blind Quiz AI</strong> is THE game that will put your speed and general knowledge to the test! \ud83c\udfaf Challenge your friends and dive into a world where movies, series, cartoons, and modified music will no longer hold any secrets for you. The AI offers you increasingly exciting challenges with every game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Why download Speed Blind - Blind Quiz AI?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>An endless challenge:</strong> Guess excerpts from movies, series, and cartoons, or recognize modified songs! Yes, the songs are real, but they've been altered\u2014it\u2019s up to you to find their title and artist! \ud83c\udfb6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Fun multiplayer mode:</strong> Face off against your friends in intense duels and claim the top spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>New challenges with every update:</strong> The AI constantly generates new puzzles to spice up your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast and addictive gameplay:</strong> Every second counts! Who will be the quickest to find the right answer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>A game for all tastes:</strong> Whether you\u2019re a movie buff, a series addict, or a music lover, there\u2019s something for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Join the competition, train your brain, and become the quiz master with Speed Blind - Blind Quiz AI!</strong> Every guess is a victory, and every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Ready to take on the challenge? Download the app now and put your brain to the test!</strong></p>",
